
  CableProbe  --  defensive USB cable analysis  (disposable test rig)

  This image observes, records and reports only. Treat any cable under
  test as hostile hardware. CableProbe cannot prove a cable is safe.

    cableprobe check
    sudo cableprobe run --name <label> -o /var/lib/cableprobe/sessions
    cableprobe report <file>

  Suggested report location on this image: /var/lib/cableprobe/sessions
  Re-flash this image between suspect cables.

